# Build logs and PID files.
# Build logs capture full `docker run` command lines. Those command lines pass
# credentials as `-e NAME=value`, so older logs contain a live
# SYNAPSE_AUTH_TOKEN in cleartext (build_all_v19.log had 47 copies).
# coderbuild/build_all.py now redacts them via _redact(), but never commit these.
*.log
build_v*.pid
